{"ID":"20240118151017-k1khm88","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151017-k1khm88","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151017-k1khm88\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151017-y6h2tez\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122152347-pjx15g6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:129,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240319144725-e17y633\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:23,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:23\u0026#125;","title":"281蜀漆","type":"doc","updated":"20240319144738"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151017-y6h2tez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151017-y6h2tez","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);","updated":"20240122152301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，平，有毒。治疟，及咳逆，寒热，腹中症坚，痞结，积聚，邪气，蛊毒。鬼疰。生川谷。又名常山。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152306-ro2tus4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152306-ro2tus4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国陕西河南四川等地，江浙亦有之，生于山野阴湿之处，为落叶小灌木，根名为常山，苗即为蜀漆。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152307-7p7kdvk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152307-7p7kdvk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦辛，性寒，有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152309-elshquu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152309-elshquu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】蜀漆为驱痰截疟要药，主袪老痰积饮，治新久诸疟，能引痰上行使吐，下行使下，逐水消肿，杀虫，疗蛊。（春夏用蜀漆，秋冬用常山）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152313-3mv0ylg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152313-3mv0ylg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗鬼蛊往来，水胀，洒洒恶寒，鼠瘘 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152319-4vsf3mc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152319-4vsf3mc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治诸疟，吐痰涎，治项下瘤瘘。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152321-28otpmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152321-28otpmx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】为治疟要药，痰疟是积湿而成的，常山苗能透达以吐之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152322-9tkf90h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152322-9tkf90h"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【药征】主治胸腹及脐下动剧者，故兼治惊狂火逆疟疾。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152324-u0f2zjf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152324-u0f2zjf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通八分至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152325-54adzhk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152325-54adzhk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】凡真气虚者忌，忌葱菜及菘茗，得甘草吐疟痰，酒炒用良。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122152257-suj1xey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152257-suj1xey","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"}},{"ID":"20240319144725-e17y633","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240319144725-e17y633","updated":"20240319144738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（注：有的人呢认为常山就是蜀漆，实际上不一样）"}]},{"ID":"20240122152326-uce9kxe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152326-uce9kxe"}},{"ID":"20240122152326-xhvlhj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152326-xhvlhj5","updated":"20240204092717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二百八十一，我们叫做“蜀漆”，这个油漆的漆啊，蜀漆，这个苗呢就叫做常山苗。一般来说，讲到常山苗大家就比较清楚啊，这是中医过去治疗疟疾的主要的处方药。这个里面的喹啉比那个喹啉的量，治疟的效果强一百倍以上。这药我们平常开处方的时候“常山”，常山。那病人往来寒热，忽冷忽热，上吐下泻，治疟的时候，我们可以使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240122152335-zp3dhj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152335-zp3dhj8","updated":"20240122152336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看它【产地】，陕西河南四川，那根呢叫常山，苗就是蜀漆，所以我们叫常山苗，常山苗。那味道是辛苦，苦味的，辛辣的，分散，性寒，所以说驱痰截疟，新久——刚得到疟疾、久疟都可以使用，统统可以使用，这个力量很强，能够杀虫。治疗脖子下的瘿瘤肿瘤都可以使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240122152341-o96amgb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152341-o96amgb","updated":"20240204092705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【唐容川】你看，治疟的要药，疟疾呢，痰疟是积湿而成的，痰——这个我们中医认为说，疟疾是因为里面有痰，所以造成上吐下泻，你把痰一清掉，疟疾就会很好，疟疾就会恢复过来。那这个抗日战争的时候用的很多，常山苗治疗疟疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240122152347-pjx15g6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122152347-pjx15g6","updated":"20240122152348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在食物上面的时候，食物经验的时候，那时候疟疾老外用喹啉，结果他们发现到：奇怪，中国人用常山呢，所以就研究常山，这个蜀漆常山，一研究发现：哇，它的里面含的喹啉的成份是他们使用的一百倍啊，所以中医早就知道了，还在《神农本草经》里面，还不是明朝的《本草纲目》，对，你说早不早？中国人厉不厉害？所以我们中医绝对很好，因为年久，好像房子年久失修了，我们把它再重新装潢、检修一下就可以。她的精神是非常好的。"}]}]}